{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30004_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:450a935775bca1508ad4abfe59c5f5547a46a8c9b5cc431c1181f0cf92aa9f12",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9be0ad9b1c583f0954e41ba88e0bef77aa553f881dcba87849f0892c7e66068",
      "text": "新的世界",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2cd5e5ce2ac65f70a373fa38e096478326c0e885895bbd7d9bd1255c7ca4523",
      "text": "悠介和享介被叫到事务所，\n听取关于新工作的说明。\n在那里他们得知W的歌曲《LEADING YOUR DREAM》\n竟然被选为了动画的主题曲。\n不仅如此，工作还不止这一项……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_a:cmd-000014:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191",
      "text": "序幕",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_a:cmd-000014:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9be0ad9b1c583f0954e41ba88e0bef77aa553f881dcba87849f0892c7e66068",
      "text": "新的世界",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_a:cmd-000016:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:346319a2c0da5a01cfc4482196d55973d6cf02cc82e3be8ebea8ab6349a41a42",
      "text": "苍井家·客厅",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_a:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b99371b17d327422866bf101fad860272efc92b8f36ec9ddc80ab32f05570599",
      "text": "早上好！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50bb27d2653309088766af6c9ada237fb8fc48a805391d3a007d9eaf5b6b93eb",
      "text": "早上好你们两个，早饭做好了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_a:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2fd9231c566a7aa13adae30e66bcb5b1293bfcf54b260d5d3e245be2b317600",
      "text": "嗯！谢谢妈！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_a:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:228ad61017b26a24acf0cf89c2feb06bb514df366e605423c04779b159ded099",
      "text": "悠介。\n酱油递我一下～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_a:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0328aac26629e9cddd953af602f2cf4521ce9c2a281e2947517bc775f55b3d9",
      "text": "给，拿去！\n享介，酱汁也帮我拿一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_a:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d20530987bf50b1507e2747d82acf1ee9aa521a31f3b2feaeac75d60324e1e59",
      "text": "呵呵呵。总觉得你们兴致勃勃的呢。\n有什么好事吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_a:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:83a609d49308e0dfeebd59469d4a6aa807d9538a80b8e38240c7a0c1676d8db5",
      "text": "嗯！其实……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_a:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:557c6f0773a573e4791d5435a9fceff2d69da4bdfd483eec97d3b7b649768eb5",
      "text": "今天有新工作的说明会哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_a:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5016c9ad338012bd108f927f4979a7e27f3d1f724a3683102bb4480080cfc940",
      "text": "哎呀，这样啊。\n要加油哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_a:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cdf8b73ade9714b3afe4d307a64577d94dc0a485fffe4dcdb9f30e2e3289a456",
      "text": "嗯！\n啊，差不多到时间了……我们出门啦——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_a:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e39b863fd4bbf686fc11c2e3c39e7c0aa505711c2bd8381da57add299d674349",
      "text": "真的耶。\n多谢款待！我们出门了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_b:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d97839694a88d3dbaae2835aa42718463b83dd8670118274c73ca9eac5ddd44c",
      "text": "事务所",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_b:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62198205f59aa29a9d4b41819279190b3c5e4b0864713983d7a84d88481388af",
      "text": "哎！？\n我们的歌被选为动画主题曲了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_b:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46696b6266cc843fca4233ab6278c8c62eca86d298b48a59d126e117007dd546",
      "text": "而且我们还要在那个动画里担任声优……？\n声优工作对我们来说还是头一回呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_b:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a4c8e68445d13041c0ad342a9b1b5ecbb2fb702cfa7347c0d1c86effc4e9103",
      "text": "是的！动画名字叫《明天跳槽去当〇〇！》，\n两位听说过吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_b:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98cc190c06f8994eee362c4aa87f6d9ae1ebc60c26968659130d3a5899c9d443",
      "text": "嗯——虽然稍微看过一点，\n但我可能不是太了解……享介呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_b:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee15a4ea464190b28f0f523d656fe06293d441997ff9e2fbf2218a73007db568",
      "text": "我也差不多吧。\n我记得……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_b:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a28ac6a80ac7644641a7f07ab4a9d0860582d6f9656cbd3ee58725b644b14182",
      "text": "应该是主角为了找到自己的天职，\n挑战各种各样职业的故事……吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5fd4ce871128619986d9153c565ecd1163a2d7a14a0b76df8a4a358ae7c557cc",
      "text": "应该是非常高人气的动画系列才对！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_b:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2eda14ba5df005615498b59122ebb90263114d764ce4b54c1e2b6b853472958",
      "text": "哇，原来是这样啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_b:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43a7732a21e2bc79767b18ccd1759b919dfc6c0b29ed83a50d7d3411c4b7997e",
      "text": "……对吧？\n●●●●●●●●●●监督。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_b:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f9978a82266d686baeed016d07f8afe00a870cc78efbe930a432933571155c3",
      "text": "是的！所以这次……第二期的主题曲\n选定了《LEADING YOUR DREAM》！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_b:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:370fd4958f54b81366baf621e5aa56c6082abe8c442a18571a1dcdb325188b1e",
      "text": "自己唱的歌居然能在动画里播放……\n太厉害了，简直像做梦一样啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_c:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a99b6ce0e097bf65aecc15bb926521394409a9d85a02ee3662b5446b8be7138e",
      "text": "关于两位作为声优出演的那一集……\n可以请你们先过目一下这份资料吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_c:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08bcb1cf3f37266ec304746d4b3470b1034ca2da7de7d2f8a1112ac1727b3514",
      "text": "好的。我看看……\n是叫《明天跳槽去当“勇者”！》的那一集……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_c:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16a73b897fdfbbeb19b7860a526cd50359206b69408c42137da64d810d53a8a4",
      "text": "……嘿，因为崇拜勇者所以去跳槽啊。\n看起来很有意思呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_c:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da61ea780625ee21b916482375b24ecd779c7865a80a04a9cf37091b6c103485",
      "text": "但是，主角这次果然还是觉得自己可能不适合……\n而感到很不安……啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_c:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67e61be77eb553176f934ecef749b813f4467aeef4c9981357b62f8621c0b4e9",
      "text": "我们要配的，\n好像就是为那样的主角加油打气的向导角色呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_c:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf4f028bf946daee4911b71732a3f63113b2c5107b1894356c0e5c2e0386c361",
      "text": "责任重大啊。\n不过……好像很有趣！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_c:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5aff79da30c7f87812190047eab570b6521d6086ca37f03c8f70938e28679bfe",
      "text": "就是说啊！\n我们会努力试试看的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_c:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9e229159e508397b4800fc10652cb4e544130430aadc767197599a98ba5b2fc",
      "text": "非常感谢！\n录音的具体日期等安排，之后会再联络你们的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_c:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ff0dd23de380f3675ab84bbb70f96ffac495e133bf7cd7f404fe02806ad98f7",
      "text": "嗯！谢谢！\n享介，回家之后开个作战会议吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_c:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:719887cadeb7d12510219d5a5db8929a1cc2b831f8d3cdd00b6364dd4abcee0b",
      "text": "嗯，当然！\n虽然是第一次难免会紧张，但一定要好好干一场！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_c:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ba826571fd0a98081f59d5996dc8bad8a10f10b822397b4bb4fd4b6d0b53025",
      "text": "让我们给看动画的观众们\n一个大大的惊喜吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_d:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0e7dee7459f09cce99ab9493a965de1c45f77d1ae28531c2a551de6cf7ef221",
      "text": "当天夜里……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_d:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45fea63559354847f5f4a993db5983b46eb5448305767a2798250e9ab368d31a",
      "text": "悠介，我找到那部动画的线上播出了。\n把之前的集数一口气补完怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_d:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4746430afb08c45779747d9f5a922237f2b495dd5941b1ed8d2b9362d189b8b2",
      "text": "好主意啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_d:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ea906d90d3a43463fbcfb06d870695a3e2083349355f6952b0d0a897cb5f3ed",
      "text": "跟●●●●●●●●●●监督说一声，\n帮我们加上配音课的练习吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_d:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db9c08fae74ae18b0b2561c325e8ad1bd53189b21ff8589d9219e6b29fee5b40",
      "text": "说的也是。课程要好好加油了。\n可不能给别人添麻烦啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_d:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ac1aca5c20a16e6cc0374cd3267fd389089633eecaf33516fe2d365066bc018",
      "text": "嗯，为此我们得好好做准备才行！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_d:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:670b4b14f7968734bb8c6176d2fa4e6e67ce7da8323c36eb8db90b64516c7f04",
      "text": "哎呀呀，看起来真开心呢。\n接到了什么样的工作呀？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_d:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5867b35d0f11ddf5a2a45651e0683b62483039bd1bb37a6ababcbf2121d26ff4",
      "text": "那个嘛……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_d:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:610dfb1d82fb24a6c3d3c426a29b43c67300146899cf07e3c9410388cdc15e6e",
      "text": "还是秘密！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_d:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af693b2bd32aa5d6e417d81621aba9ed7d514157e96b225d7fec63e8cf8c76dc",
      "text": "敬请期待发表的那一天吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_d:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90dbd1dca7e2106d5c4b0bfd2b825c4add1cbc4ec21f99720fe7e3a1986cb152",
      "text": "呵呵呵，我知道了。\n那我就好好期待着哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_d:cmd-000082:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17e878f38e813eba43963174bc75322e0c0a40873a848741b1ea1d1207d38cc7",
      "text": "……●●●●●●●●●●监督？\n是我，享介。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_d:cmd-000084:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce98fb21f4bc95d4691c3cf44ff73da4714fe739c44e644edb65a5de64680e83",
      "text": "刚才我和悠介在聊下一份工作的事。\n然后有个小小的请求。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_d:cmd-000086:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16f01eda24c1940de1c0fab77d3776d5f05a821056b5fe7ca76c8a1b1220474b",
      "text": "能不能帮我们安排一下配音课呢？\n可以帮我们确认一下日程吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_d:cmd-000088:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3491415c96e5b9f9f9fd32915d7c365b7cf9a75db89af304c9f818c683d648fe",
      "text": "……好像没问题？太好了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_d:cmd-000090:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cf46e913a16d2970638e52d235a08261a200545dd85b7e4485ab88799101748",
      "text": "我也会向讲师\n确认一下的",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_d:cmd-000092:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1006cc1af276fc99edc59fb733478aa2dda97f3492f88975ddef3417abddfd14",
      "text": "嗯！谢谢监督！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_d:cmd-000096:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3d012ca1adca48a17e1ff10ae3b5735dcf981ed4b00ed008e927fdfd0f6dc8c",
      "text": "咦？\n享介，你在打电话吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_d:cmd-000098:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb1cb6467e1e6ad051b0ff76f46b4ef0550029f38be21d9205f09ae70e79f4fa",
      "text": "是啊，在跟●●●●●●●●●●监督通话。\n监督说会帮我们安排配音课的练习。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_d:cmd-000100:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b6f8f8fbf3c4b2af08128a99549d4ae4222312453233e35144721f1e6fad2f9e",
      "text": "这样啊！\n谢谢监督！拜托你啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_d:cmd-000102:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d297d407d7c643349f7bc3ca0b5dbe047f9a0c6d73816ba78288ef26bf9e560",
      "text": "那就先这样，●●●●●●●●●●监督。\n日期定下来之后再联络我们哦～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_e:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_e:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1cb1978d389b7e6f6fb508fa1c55eec4ffd8e9b12c3b738e8dbb623acde66a3c",
      "text": "哇啊——！\n没想到主角居然会变成这样啊——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_e:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eedef0a455fc64e99609e65478e51873b7a847ec81107c60bf66ba8a6d5f4847",
      "text": "呐呐，享介。台本你读到哪里了？\n这里的剧情展开，是不是超绝？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_e:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aaa7a0e708dadf552c3ac0abf24b29141ee82e52f77d03ca419a50fd0b6c481b",
      "text": "知道了，知道了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_e:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7ee52367d1598863d4ee6d02d0d9de2c650807e1a9b0c08f0b18c3839bf1af1",
      "text": "拿到《明日转》的台本会很兴奋我能理解，\n但你再冷静一点啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_e:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6519b0294638fa4a14d0417ddbf6800d5c00c0e24782b30f958c819a8c2f8668",
      "text": "抱歉抱歉。\n可是真的太有趣了嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_e:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d136b3ebd596c304001c6b3237ca758e12a687f22fc9cbe93f483d09d44382ba",
      "text": "我懂的。挑战当勇者的烦恼描绘得非常细致，\n让人不由自主地被吸引进故事里呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_e:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33d1a4357f5ca88a64f9e4b93b56c9103a29648aaeb76a4b8910e5a307b69493",
      "text": "就是说啊！\n一直在想接下来会怎样，完全看入迷了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_e:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a52a91ab665f51d3a55e48a7bbc110f199a4f498ef0416006a683f6c50f4c358",
      "text": "无论对谁来说，迈出新的一步\n都是需要勇气的吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_e:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ea0be98ab5ce737662901be357cc60acfcab82428c6ca0af74dca5ea3b80276",
      "text": "嗯！为了改变自己的世界而不断努力的\n主角真的好厉害啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_e:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:707891fa371c660cd21fed11e1299f8812d215d62e9cf29599f5246b990425b1",
      "text": "（……改变世界，吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_f:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e60f32f53b88fbc47aa59da2b146b0b25d56c165908b15b1f927968c62c3ceaa",
      "text": "（以前，我们经常被别人说\n分不清双胞胎里的谁是谁呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_f:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e037cfa3799f30382c039f4a851cd3328300a546ac82ce7bc3cdb4607b973d93",
      "text": "（当我说是弟弟的时候，就会被取笑说\n“那也就是说你比较弱咯”之类的……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_f:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:abc65c53140ff7095af315de98325d6496b210713beb669677d0fe01c107d131",
      "text": "喂！那个比较弱的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_f:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2709d54799dc72d0cac29ef4ba962af032a370060b382922fc322ebf6c74d9e6",
      "text": "比较弱的……？说谁呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_f:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6edecbd8571426361923cfb3a96c0acca20b4ccd609950185e1a2171352130e0",
      "text": "应该是在说我吧。他们说弟弟就是比较弱。\n随他们说去吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_f:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:252c0794b7c53aeda2fd2f77f3b855334593f1e9f3f1aee33f81dd6449f396bb",
      "text": "弟弟比较弱……？胡说什么呢。\n为什么享介你也不反驳一句啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_f:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e9852aad0c6b27b460e8d42d3e93326f25c1cca13da90dfa60fcac94c98d45b",
      "text": "（反正就算反驳了对方也不会理解，\n那时的我已经放弃了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_f:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0fed66da65bd1acfb6f96a400e69e1a3e04648fab3496658ed91c1ac7346f4dd",
      "text": "（但是……悠介却替我发了火，\n把那家伙给教训了一顿呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_f:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b3163797b954c262fc6eec0fcd8342a446e577e993d9c6efbcf5b19bbab417a",
      "text": "谢谢你，悠介。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_f:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7cae617a1f613b93a21fab26ee7ddf355e1573f9892ad07ba8cf1aea85fda4b7",
      "text": "应该说是我的好胜心作祟吧……\n因为那听起来就像在说我也很弱一样，我很不爽而已。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_f:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23eab2fa320ad0d26020d5987d53259ec4ea44884c9ed461ceb86e42711f063a",
      "text": "（虽然他说得轻描淡写，\n但那样的悠介在我眼里看起来帅极了呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_g:cmd-000010:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9948e792ade10e0cb8f4d045ad627378f2285202e6e19e074b1d689e1c091c02",
      "text": "（那样率直、又有点不顾后果的悠介，\n总是会改变我的世界）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_g:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b9c23ef95ee625e8160a05bd951db66139efeebe12a546f05c88780e97fa67f",
      "text": "（打破我内心的“放弃”\n以及“这都是没办法的”这种看待世界的方式）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_g:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d912a36dac9f083cb2a5ea2d8ddf850e2b7d3927565f696732e816764f9e97d",
      "text": "（嘛，虽然有时也会觉得有点麻烦就是了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_g:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c44140490f7acb7921d8b7c27e06e9faca28060ed5170d6ad2dc5d4ed9f8e20",
      "text": "（但如果是两个人在一起，总觉得今后\n无论到哪里都能不断超越极限）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_g:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3aac4b782c6553588cfd36bffa036cd2da28626ca239817edcd3a05be4bcaea8",
      "text": "呐，悠介。\n关于以前发生的事，你还记……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_g:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7f0ad90b24efebbd4cc8dfbafc777ecbf34f8766bbca14284ff67c86ae0677f",
      "text": "呼——…呼——……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_g:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c0e5fa195ee475f46f70975cb40a01ea817991ae34bbbff137fb5988ffb46c4",
      "text": "……已经睡着了。\n明明刚才还那么有精神的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_g:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fdde76a38fecf2d2a3b89cd3d2cec7dc709f670c56b10d294072d57373a6396c",
      "text": "真是的，悠介可太随性了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_g:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d14e09e5ae81e6c1518e938cee1f72d6e23df2f6eb7d762837e1d69cff5435d",
      "text": "（……《明日转》的主角或许也会感到不安，\n但你不是孤身一人。还有我们在）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_g:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9560854462409447ab987772ffcb43458f2bf7e56a282f6173f0a1158486dbf6",
      "text": "和我们一起，迈向全新的世界吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_h:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:150cf7004730a0d0640fb5937c5f5182649bcb49fdaa853651bbdca5af477d08",
      "text": "录音当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_h:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c84bef78db2cb8336a393a94af7f27fcf2358a7f74bb28c07bcfb03695c47733",
      "text": "“向着全新的世界出发吧！\n就算失败了，那也是变得更强大的机会！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_h:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9bc9d5ca366185dd364f913e5819c15df403dfe619c4e9c255e0431774cfa61",
      "text": "“无论是好是坏……\n都能看到与现在不一样的风景呢”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_h:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a5e265adc743d94a248a6e1d17bdfab95f597c66f966949a9e775cc0f788c1d",
      "text": "“光是这样，不就超级开心的嘛！\n想要蜕变成全新的自己，全靠你的勇气哦”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_h:cmd-000041:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f10f377623d30a2f8e6eef9924c2cd8b7962dcbd80ad5f1e46aca35a570d7f4",
      "text": "录音结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_h:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b60b25c734cd9ac03d62a691d4f42771fa1bbbfcddff1ba72c88e1297a3b636",
      "text": "呼……结束了。\n虽然很紧张，但能顺利结束真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_h:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd9ff72ade177f25bb96c83a7dffd9dbe8e7781bad3f5b0681aa284869aaa05d",
      "text": "辛苦了。\n两位表现得都非常出色！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_h:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9069c8f4444c42cc44d7aaa39e4f915b87cfede9b6b2f2466a2ae131186ff2dc",
      "text": "谢谢！配音练习什么的，\n多亏了享介考虑了那么多呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_h:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:618ed43aeb1093c04c18a3f7592fe9e598a221b0abfc3def59cfd9984e58c147",
      "text": "也是多亏了●●●●●●●●●●监督的\n协助啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_h:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94b7a5997e18b38211188cef985f4a254b9f4643181d9b6634517c27dd7b6c4f",
      "text": "两位，今天辛苦了。\n演技非常饱含深情，非常棒哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_h:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58471f6287ce1966246f83ae4c9bc532c3912a1cc5a67419b83b6731db9492b0",
      "text": "我们才要感谢您！\n真的非常开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_h:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a60ba38e2496ad7bb4a64a65c70763e8165b115110c529cdfda06a8e567a3926",
      "text": "很期待正式播出的那天。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_h:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2a8f4689dca88c29c0faebc842052602c5dea2a431a235b76d50f4a3b54c7f2",
      "text": "辛苦各位了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_i:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "数小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_i:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d21bed7f196381153e7d50d86a5ac423f457b5d1c5be394162d5588531fda9d4",
      "text": "我觉得自己表现得相当棒呢。\n大家都被我的演技给惊到了♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_i:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e397957ee1a59cc41477697bcdb85eb7b625d8364bbfb3fa0e1ffc8c7e9d96eb",
      "text": "不对不对，明明是我说得更好。\n大家都在看着我呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_i:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ae9075e8643a56baec424a11ded68bb198e5a8fab94d7aff22f35303468e495",
      "text": "是那样吗？\n我觉得明明是我演得更好啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_i:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da76218e46640ef7671bff13a419aa31e573d7cf79fbf1f52c360bce85f3fb10",
      "text": "呐，●●●●●●●●●●监督。\n你觉得谁的表现更好？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_i:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ac4dc16d4a15651876b938d44d8695a910388fa1a24a6f8f43d1735032145d2",
      "text": "难分伯仲呢。\n两位都非常棒哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_i:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0c561f4368395182587daaf6d43906bfaab0fe783280e8ef85c3eb578d3573f",
      "text": "嘿嘿，是吗～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_i:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d5d5ca4e0d38825fd8bd4e4a5796a2ba3efc8cc84d3ea7b6fcfb7592c23937f",
      "text": "不过既然……\n●●●●●●●●●●监督都这么说了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_i:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3f0bff2feb1bfac5ecf5fb78a45842d1235f7f4b3fbccb652008c872bd54ead",
      "text": "那就暂且这么算吧♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_i:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1cb18f30ec8996b5524544878ab5c81a38a040f65585da1d16317d74c91a860",
      "text": "哈哈哈！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_i:cmd-000076:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d97839694a88d3dbaae2835aa42718463b83dd8670118274c73ca9eac5ddd44c",
      "text": "事务所",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_i:cmd-000083:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a119cb2b7d5fb5b00dd2e9150a1c5c16b1ffac21aa57acf94157f1ea5dc044a2",
      "text": "今天录音辛苦啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_i:cmd-000085:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87f57d92cf04f92a7f9be9853cf9f6122be1ee1e50e2a78aa0bcadb98305e633",
      "text": "辛苦啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_i:cmd-000087:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54949ab98e6caf0422477bc0bba4f971996341706e312e9a1d7048baf4485356",
      "text": "说起来录音时候的画面，\n和平时看的动画\n稍微有点不一样呢<emoji>image_talk_emoji_08</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_i:cmd-000089:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e865c5d4d5c923247a1dca5efd17f66f94b9944dffcec12370ce04a49a4ad106",
      "text": "对对，像是草稿一样的感觉…\n而且还没有上色",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_i:cmd-000091:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ebeacd9a982d14d97983cf489dc046313cc4336ed1162b3e1d8a37445be3937e",
      "text": "原来动画一开始是那种样子的啊！\n长见识了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_i:cmd-000093:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5232aa83a8f61f84bcf7a5194ff1f0718d03909d541d9096e4983b26860a7397",
      "text": "一想到那些画面涂上颜色动起来，\n就让人兴奋不已呢<emoji>image_talk_emoji_16</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_i:cmd-000095:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a5281c9995e6ec63d3cb981c089b4e7a63d0c16029e8b7e4cebd5951d9e0cb3",
      "text": "真的会播放配上了我们声音的\n动画吗<emoji>image_talk_emoji_08</emoji>\n总觉得还没有实感呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_i:cmd-000097:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:813dea62b5b93218c16a6f327bc617b6fff59fd6a8b7cce7f16de90b416cea6a",
      "text": "离播出\n还有一段时间呢…\n真是迫不及待了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_i:cmd-000099:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20753d958822439239c8f9167e6584493aaaf7991e850246bf0cb9d992925471",
      "text": "真让人期待呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_i:cmd-000099:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7fb58b02cb7ab0996b301a6f2bd70d29451d393a719566713c1bfaed2603c32a",
      "text": "很期待播出的那天呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_i:cmd-000102:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a04b0723cc8e2f3ac840f69cfcffb2ab2c1005f342fac69fde2be29ffef2f33c",
      "text": "嗯！\n超级期待<emoji>image_talk_emoji_36</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_i:cmd-000104:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b73e1f18747ceaac7f93869042fa9d4ee9d93218106173a65007c64e3d677ef",
      "text": "我也是！\n我会每周看着动画\n耐心等待的<emoji>image_talk_emoji_05</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_j:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d965a68f5e0550a97b9a88ee052acec6053f574104b9ee435cdfd7a9528840de",
      "text": "播出当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_j:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:724857b547b32efe3f7fb9176ae41a19b7ae04ff6a8474f83588e45a35372273",
      "text": "终于在今天，要在电视上播出了啊……！\n开始紧张起来了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_j:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f08d958213702d0cd5fe24192d99cc8eca85e9bbcae4d8c0bfb7312656ba03bb",
      "text": "是啊。\n我也因为太激动，昨晚根本睡不着呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_j:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34db10b39ae7e0cdfbe0d7cf943041cf417af209771ff53d31880ee718c37396",
      "text": "我也是～\n不知道●●●●●●●●●●监督有没有在看呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_j:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b52c35036fa2fd392eaff35e89ae13698a39b253d836d7107c644433d44154e5",
      "text": "……啊！开始了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_j:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eadd849ca3ccfe16dbf9b967741e551e4ef2dd61b902501d125e0191ab0bcce8",
      "text": "厉害！\n我们配音的角色好好地出场了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_j:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a5e265adc743d94a248a6e1d17bdfab95f597c66f966949a9e775cc0f788c1d",
      "text": "“光是这样，不就超级开心的嘛！\n想要蜕变成全新的自己，全靠你的勇气哦”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_j:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:83b77ac542c0ba8904724016270eabc71e1deafd80947e62102797aeefce8def",
      "text": "说、说话了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_j:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ac6f77381b714cf79d65b59d016dd15077df566e9cff47594c3ce21fe9a1be9",
      "text": "不过和专业的声优相比，\n我们果然还差得远呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_j:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0b9a82ce8f080035259911e82f67a0035dd864f94fbfb2fa56bf12a9f9f952f",
      "text": "虽然有点害羞……但是，\n能看到配上自己声音的角色动起来，超开心的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_j:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:645d02cee11c47368bb8e5370cc08dcd9eb9a83af6c4750b88de938a82a39e7d",
      "text": "嗯，我也是。超级开心的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_k:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c444011f87be92a51fc9901bc4f3a46ccab37ccbd02fbc038a7ddff2b83cf8f0",
      "text": "看完后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_k:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3cd149fcf68e781a370c8901c3dfab2d35e8e4be4ce22bfc42d696105a2e965",
      "text": "……呼。\n三十分钟过得真快啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_k:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c324c1637d5e3675efa33937f9fc8e5b4ca30daf7cc81e9874d0b9813831e98e",
      "text": "因为太紧张，手心全是汗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_k:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:640620afdb632b9376f181cda1e963f1eab3456240646779c7a48a2842ae4067",
      "text": "不过声优的工作，也挺有意思的啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_k:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:82e6c5ed6d326d2e0f8a600b585256f1ff926cde65f79aff8bed88f7d9dfefe3",
      "text": "是啊。虽然一开始在想会变成什么样，\n但真是一次很棒的经历呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_k:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f408ca9ba68db1dda750e7c687d793870ea6810ca5e0fea5c0b1a1b12d8ecb8",
      "text": "嗯。虽然面对新事物会感到不安，\n但能看到不一样的风景，感觉挺棒的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_k:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d9eff50fa7cc4b5e81e8a71ba4ab2f9572d0ab488720906c2abcfcc491104e6",
      "text": "《明日转》的主角也是这样的心情吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_k:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d4b0a7356277ac6880f4c33ab53cfadf43a79fc391d66f99d16651137b870a0",
      "text": "肯定没错！\n享介……今后我们两个人也要一起加油啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_k:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a62dca3f0d7efefb6cf0610d5546164c3d7cd47e2450123d763185e9c7110bd",
      "text": "嗯。目标是成为顶尖偶像！对吧。\n如果是我们两个人的话，绝对能够做到的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_k:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:896954c7a973c90069d4891a123ff1095c1a1fbf6d2f6dd91997e72eaacdf2e6",
      "text": "啊！今后两个人也要一起全力冲刺啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
